{"id":"faculty-avantika_singh:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Avantika Singh is an Assistant Professor in Data Science and Artificial Intelligence discipline. Prior to joining IIIT-NR, Dr. Singh was an Assistant professor at IIIT Dharwad and IIIT Una. She has completed her Ph.D from the School of Computing, IIT Mandi in the area of machine learning. She has completed her B.Tech and M.Tech from Uttar Pradesh Technical University, Lucknow and Amity University, Noida respectively.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
